# PDF Injection — files excluded from the Docker build context.
# Mirrors .gitignore plus Docker/VCS-specific exclusions. Both
# apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile COPY the full workspace (Bun
# workspace monorepo, workspace:* deps require it), so keeping this list
# accurate matters for build context size and avoiding stale local state
# leaking into images.

# VCS / editor
.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# oh-my-agent runtime (local artifacts — never needed inside an image)
.agents/results/
.agents/state/
.agents/backup/
.antigravitycli/
docs/plans/
.migration-backup/
.qwen/tmp/

# Dependencies (reinstalled inside the image via `bun install --frozen-lockfile`)
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Local runtime data / build output
.pdf-injection-data/
**/.pdf-injection-data/
dist/
**/dist/
build/
**/build/
coverage/
**/coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Test artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/
tests/e2e/.tmp/
tests/e2e/.auth/

# Env / secrets — never bake these into an image; pass at `docker run` /
# docker-compose `environment:` instead.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Research outputs (kept local; not needed for the running app)
research/results/*
!research/results/README.md
!research/results/.gitkeep
